<item>
 <title>The Mathon Archive - can you help?</title>
 <link>https://www.mathon.org.uk/forum/news-announcements/the-mathon-archive-can-you-help</link>
 <description>&lt;p&gt;I am collecting material for a Mathon Archive. The point of this is&lt;br /&gt;
to try to get in one place all the items concerning Mathon&#039;s past, or&lt;br /&gt;
if not the items, then to create a gazetteer of what&#039;s around. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;So far this trawl has produced the usual meeting minutes from the&lt;br /&gt;
Church and the Parish Hall, but any other contributions would be&lt;br /&gt;
welcome. If you&#039;ve any contributions, please either reply to this&lt;br /&gt;
comment on the web site, or call me on 01886 880578.&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
 <comments>https://www.mathon.org.uk/forum/news-announcements/the-mathon-archive-can-you-help#comments</comments>
 <category domain="https://www.mathon.org.uk/taxonomy/term/9">News &amp; Announcements</category>
 <pubDate>Sun, 16 Mar 2008 00:46:41 +0000</pubDate>
